{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13399","headline":"古兴 · 薛据","name":"古兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日中望双阙，轩盖扬飞尘。\n鸣佩初罢朝，自言皆近臣。\n光华满道路，意气安可亲。\n归来宴高堂，广筵罗八珍。\n仆妾尽绮纨，歌舞夜达晨。\n四时固相代，谁能久要津。\n已看覆前车，未见易後轮。\n丈夫须兼济，岂能乐一身。\n君今皆得志，肯顾憔悴人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}